  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger, and cook until softened, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add curry powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add cod fillets and cook for 2 minutes on each side.",
    "Add coconut milk, apple cider vinegar, cinnamon, and cayenne pepper.",
    "Stir in tobiko.",
    "Cover the pot and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook for 8 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional tobiko if desired."
